      <div class="page-inner hero-content">
        <span class="badge-pill">Cross-Channel Footwear Guide</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">UK to EU Shoe Size Converter</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Convert British (UK) shoe sizes to Continental European (EU) sizes accurately. Compare comprehensive men's, women's, and children's charts with size 8, size 10 benchmarks, Paris Point formulas, and centimeter lengths.</p>
        
